00:00:34.712 --> 00:00:36.181
from the spaghetti episode.

00:00:36.181 --> 00:00:37.014
Mmm.

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:38.410
- I took the first bite.

00:00:38.410 --> 00:00:40.061
I was scared I couldn't bite it off,

00:00:40.061 --> 00:00:42.621
