they dropped me in a pool.

00:04:10.505 --> 00:04:12.211
(Titanic flute music)

00:04:12.211 --> 00:04:13.378
- Insult.
- Oh.

00:04:13.941 --> 00:04:15.272
- Did he just die?

00:04:15.272 --> 00:04:16.301
- Did he just die?

00:04:16.301 --> 00:04:17.650
- They'll get theirs.

00:04:17.650 --> 00:04:20.651
