00:04:26.925 --> 00:04:27.974
at different price points.

00:04:27.974 --> 00:04:28.807
- Mm-hmm.

00:04:28.807 --> 00:04:30.736
Adam said spiders, I'd have to agree.

00:04:30.736 --> 00:04:32.319
Probably, crickets.

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:35.221
- I'd probably say
peanut butter and jelly.

00:04:35.221 --> 00:04:36.901
- "How is Adam doing?

00:04:36.901 --> 00:04:38.329
And "Does he get enough food?"

00:04:38.329 --> 00:04:39.918
- Adam, do you want to
answer for yourselr?

00:04:39.918 --> 00:04:41.701
Or do you want me to take this one?

00:04:41.701 --> 00:04:43.451
- You wanna answer how he's doing?

00:04:43.451 --> 00:04:44.489
