00:04:44.489 --> 00:04:46.971
but Adam is currently eating
a peanut butter and jelly.

00:04:46.971 --> 00:04:47.804
(laughs)

00:04:47.804 --> 00:04:49.232
- How are you doing?

00:04:49.232 --> 00:04:51.315
- He just went like this.

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:53.240
- And now the final question,

00:04:53.240 --> 00:04:55.302
"Have you ever disliked the food

00:04:55.302 --> 00:04:56.409
